Error [jet.ReservedPackedLayout]: `packed` is reserved and not yet supported as a layout argument
  --> tests/ui/layout_c_packed_reserved.jet:1:12
    |
  1 | #Layout(c, packed)
    |            ^^^^^^
 Why: Removing a struct's padding has no defined layout contract yet; after `c`, a struct takes only `align(N)` or `align(target, N)`
 Fix: Remove `packed`; `#Layout(c)` keeps the written field order, so listing the widest fields first leaves the least padding
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1105
